Z||000000||Haze_Performance||10-23-2000||02:10 AM||||<B> THIS IS TO ANYONE THAT FEELS THAT ITS NOT PROPER TO POST FIERO PARTS IN THE FORUM: <P>I'VE READ THE LAST FEW CONTROVERSIAL TOPICS THAT WERE POSTED. I FIND NOTHING WRONG WITH THEM AT ALL. THIS IS A FIERO MESSAGE BOARD. ITS INTENT IS TO ASK QUESTIONS, TALK ABOUT & BUY/SELL FIERO RELATED ITEMS. IF YOU ARE OFFENDED BY THE CONTENT (RELATED TO THIS TYPE TOPIC) DON'T READ IT. I DON'T SEE CLIFF ACCUSING ANYONE OF WRONG DOING & THIS IS HIS CHAT SITE. PEOPLE ARE JUST TRYING TO GET THE WORD OUT ON PART'S FOR THE PONTIAC FIERO. I THINK IT'S ABOUT TIME FOR YOU TO GET OFF YOUR HIGH HORSE. WE DON'T NEED A CYBER COP IN HERE TELLING US WHAT IS PROPER OR NOT. THIS POST ISN'T DIRECTED TOWARD ANYONE IN GENERAL. IN ADDITION I BELIEVE THAT THIS TOPIC WAS POSTED IT THE CORRECT PLACE. I'M NOT SELLING ANYTHING, I'M JUST LETTING PEOPLE KNOW ABOUT A PRODUCT THAT I FOUND THAT SOME MAY WANT TO PURCHASE.</B><P><B>FLAME ON IF YOU FEEL THE NEED, BUT TRUTHFULLY I FEEL THAT IT WOULD JUST SHOW YOUR IGNORANCE.</B><P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004086.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004086.html</A> <P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif"> <BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A>-                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||8
