Z||000013||Raydar||10-23-2000||01:11 PM||||WTIII, I was getting Spam lonnnng before I signed on to the Forum. Started about the time I registered my "Alldata" CD. <BR>Of course I would *never* point any fingers.<BR>Just wouldn't. Nudge, nudge.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<P>Out of my mind.<BR>Back in five minutes.||||reg||1
Z||000014||Cliff Pennock||10-23-2000||01:14 PM||||<B>*** IMPORTANT ***</B><P>Sorry for the bold, caps-only header, but I feel it to be important enough for as many people as possible to read.<P>Regarding receiving spam since joining here: that's a coincidence. The only way people can get an email address from this board is if they click on "profile" for every single member and manually copy the email address. Since I often check my log files I can assure you that has never happened. Member's email addresses are protected quite good and I myself would never, ever give out the member's email-address database.<P>I don't want people reading this and thinking "hmmm, better not join the forum or else I'll receive spam".||||reg||4
Z||000015||Tigger||10-23-2000||01:51 PM||||Cliff, I appreciate your honesty in keeping our emails confidential and not giving them out.  I'm very sorry if I had made it look like I was pointing the finger at you.  I wasn't, I just wanted to see if I was the only one getting spam.<P>I think what is happening, and it has been my thought all along is people (with a lot of spare time on their hands) are visiting the board, going thru profiles, writing down as many emails and using them to send spam.  I know there is just about nothing Cliff or anyone can do to stop it.<P>WTIII, I'd give you a link but just type in <A HREF="http://www.(insert" TARGET=_blank>www.(insert</A>  whatever dirty word that comes from the top of your head here).com and you'll find it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000016||Cliff Pennock||10-23-2000||01:59 PM||||Actually, I <B>didn't</B> take it that way (finger pointing, I mean). I'm just pretty protective about this forum.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000017||Raydar||10-23-2000||02:10 PM||||Cliff, and others, <BR>That was my point, as well. <BR>To re-emphaasize... <BR>I've never even entertained the idea that I have received any spam as a result of being here. <P>I believe that most of the serious spammers have bots that search the usenet newsgroups for e-mail addresses. <BR>Since I post to usenet, and my e-mail address is *not* spam-blocked (It confused people that really wanted to e-mail me), I'm actually surprised that I don't receive any more than I do. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<P>Out of my mind.<BR>Back in five minutes.||||reg||14
